LOCATION:Birdland Jazz Club\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:NEW YORK\, NY --- Birdland is proud to present AMANDA GREEN & F
 
ANTASTIC FRIENDS on Monday\, October 5 at 7pm. Join two-time Tony Award and
 
 Grammy Award-nominated songwriter and performer Amanda Green and a spectac
 
ular lineup of Broadway friends for a hilarious evening of Green's songs\, 
 
including performances from the upcoming musicals Regency Girls\, featuring
 
 several of the show's stars\, and Crazy Rich Asians. Scheduled to perform 
 
are Jonathan Dokuchitz (The Who's Tommy\, Anastasia)\, Krystina Alabado (Re
 
gency Girls\, Hazbin Hotel)\; Jasmine Forsberg (SIX)\; Cailen Fu (Mean Girl
 
s)\; Sarah Kay (Here Lies Love)\; three-time Emmy-nominated composer Curtis
 
 Moore (Regency Girls\, The Marvelous Mrs. Maisel)\; Kate Rockwell (Mean Gi
 
rls\, Bring It On)\; Ryann Redmond (Heated Rivalry: The Unauthorized Parody
 
\, Frozen)\; Alanna Saunders (Harry Potter and the Cursed Child)\; Musical 
 
Direction by Annbritt duChateau (Once Upon A Mattress\, Sondheim's Old Frie
 
nds) and Drums\, Joe Nero (Sunset Boulevard\, Schmigadoon). Tickets & info:
 
 https://www.ticketweb.com/event/amanda-green-fantastic-friends-birdland-ja
 
zz-club-tickets/14282074
